templates: 6 from 1 file(s)
  greet {who*}
  spaced {who}
  twice {who}
  optional {note}
  braces
  two {a, b}
  ! <t>/e/r.templates: "spanning" uses {{and, much later, a}}, which it does not declare

== filling them ==
  greet -> <hello Ada!>
  spaced -> <hello Ada>
  twice -> <Ada and Ada>
  optional -> <note: (none)>
  optional -> <note: hi>
  braces -> <a {{ with no closer after it>
  nosuch -> refused: no template called "nosuch"

== a required hole with nothing to put in it ==
  greet -> refused: greet needs a value for who
  greet -> refused: greet needs a value for who

== a value that looks like a placeholder is not one ==
  two -> <[{{b}}][SECRET]>

== what a text asks for ==
  <plain text> -> []
  <{{a}} and {{b}} and {{a}}> -> ["a","b"]
  <{{ spaced }}> -> ["spaced"]
  <an unclosed {{ brace> -> []
  <}} alone> -> []
